# Time Vault enters tapped and doesn't untap. When Bot1's turn would begin with it tapped, Bot1 may skip that turn
# instead (CR 614.10) and untap it: the turn is not taken, so Bot2's turn is turn 3 and Bot1's next is turn 4. There
# {T}: take an extra turn after this one, which is turn 5 for Bot1 again; the Vault is tapped and its offer declined.
[Bot1 Deck]
Island x2
Time Vault
Mox Jet
Island x3
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Time Vault.Cast
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot2.Main1]
? Turn = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Time Vault.Tapped = false
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Time Vault.Activate
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Time Vault.Tapped = true
[Expect]
Turn = 5
ActivePlayer = Bot1
